OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 15 MAY
OL,4,G2200FLate Junction
OL,5,     GVerity Sharp brings a selection
OL,6,     Gof adventurous music for the
OL,7,     Gsmall and the waking hours, plus
OL,8,     Gshe dips into the line-up for
OL,9,     Gthis year's Atonal and Unsound
OL,10,     Gfestival in Berlin.
OL,11,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,12,     GIn this Friday's edition of
OL,13,     G'Round Midnight, Soweto shares
OL,14,     Ghighlights from a performance by
OL,15,     GAmerican guitarist Mary Halvorson
OL,16,     Gand her Amaryllis Sextet recorded
OL,17,     Gin Finland.
